rank_score = w1 * boost_tier
           + w2 * freelancer_reputation_score
           + w3 * profile_completeness
           + w4 * proposal_relevance (keyword overlap with job)
           + w5 * recency_bonus (new proposals get a small lift)
           + w6 * price_competitiveness (closeness to budget)
           - w7 * red_flags (template proposals, low response rate)
